    {
      "id": "legendText",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 574,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 10032,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 20032,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Collector lifecycle notes\n\n1. First domain hit can return via generic scrape while discovery/provisioning runs.\n2. Active domain collectors handle later traffic through Scraper Studio.\n3. Request/product thresholds can add load_shard collectors up to max per domain.\n4. Only DataQualityError is healable; auth, zone, and command failures bubble as explicit errors.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Collector lifecycle notes\n\n1. First domain hit can return via generic scrape while discovery/provisioning runs.\n2. Active domain collectors handle later traffic through Scraper Studio.\n3. Request/product thresholds can add load_shard collectors up to max per domain.\n4. Only DataQualityError is healable; auth, zone, and command failures bubble as explicit errors.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 174
    },
